.git
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Trained artifacts and datasets are resolved from the Hugging Face Hub at run
# time, never baked into an image.
services/*/checkpoints
services/*/data

# `datasets/` means two different things across these services: raw third-party
# corpora in the audio ones, and a Python package of dataset wrappers in the vision
# ones. Exclude only the corpora -- a blanket rule silently drops the vision
# services' own package, and the image then fails on import rather than on build.
services/whisper-fine-tuning/datasets
services/speech-emotion-recognition/datasets
**/wandb

# Figures and notebooks are for GitHub. The frontend is the exception: it renders
# its own assets, and its Dockerfile lives in that service.
notebooks
**/*.ipynb

.env
